      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's probably the same reason why you don't want your date of birth to be shown. You can only join a 18+ instance if you are 18+ verified, so It makes no sense.\n\nFor example: you want to know the Age of a User who is just \"Age Verified\" but not 18 yet.\n\nYou just have to check the profile daily to determine their age (You will see if they turn 18).\n\nThis is probably the main reason.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
