      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My concern is that, by essentially making it even more of a no-brainer for bad-actors to make an alternate account, we actually make it harder to detect them by removing some really valuable red flags that can easily be detected and investigated, we make VRChat Trust and Safety's job harder, and bad-actors won't be deterred because it only takes 30 seconds to make a new account without the verified flag.\n\nPut simply, it's much better to have a bad actor incorrectly think they're less visible, when really they're just as visible to their friends and VRChat's Trust and Safety Team, then to basically force/guide them to a solution where they are actually less-visible to the people who can actually do something about bad behaviour.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
