      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6799a9647fed89b86c6680f2|full_name} I absolutlely agree. That there is 2 badges and that when you are confirmed to be 18 years or older you still have access to the other one is crazy. You should not be able to hide that you are 18+ There is no usecase to be able to turn that off if you had it on once. I think when you age verify and you are not 18+ and then turn 18, you should be given a timeframe during which you can update it, lets say a month, and then its locked. There is no reason for adults to larp as minors or below 18s",
